<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE - AUGUST 5.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE - AUGUST 5.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timetable for fourth day of</p>
<p>competition at the world athletics championships on Tuesday</p>
<p>(all times GMT):</p>
<p>0500 - Decathlon - 100 metres</p>
<p>0510 - Women's discus qualifying round, group A</p>
<p>0535 - Women's 400 metres hurdles first round</p>
<p>0600 - Decathlon - long jump, two groups</p>
<p>0615 - Men's 110 metres hurdles first round</p>
<p>0650 - Women's discus qualifying round, group B</p>
<p>0740 - Decathlon - shot put, two groups</p>
<p>1445 - Decathlon - high jump</p>
<p>1500 - Men's 800 metres second round</p>
<p>1540 - Men's javelin final</p>
<p>1540 - Men's 110 metres hurdles second round</p>
<p>1600 - Men's long jump final</p>
<p>1640 - Women's 1,500 metres final</p>
<p>1645 - Women's shot put qualifying round, two groups</p>
<p>1655 - Women's 10,000 metres final</p>
<p>1740 - Men's 400 metres finalo</p>
<p>1805 - Decathlon - 400 metres</p>
